 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg4-00",
   "text": "验证者这一端，风险出在签名上。",
   "spoken": "验证者这一端，风险出在签名上。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep17/audio/lines/seg4-00.mp3",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 3.552,
   "speechStart": 1.698,
   "speechEnd": 4.317
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-01",
   "text": "罚没，是 PoS 验证者违反协议，被扣除部分质押并强制退出。",
   "spoken": "罚莫，是 PoS 验证者违反协议，被扣除部分质押并强制退出。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep17/audio/lines/seg4-01.mp3",
   "start": 5.372,
   "dur": 6.36,
   "speechStart": 5.47,
   "speechEnd": 10.886
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-02",
   "text": "最常见的原因是双签。",
   "spoken": "最常见的原因是双签。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep17/audio/lines/seg4-02.mp3",
   "start": 11.952,
   "dur": 3.0,
   "speechStart": 12.05,
   "speechEnd": 14.145
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-03",
   "text": "同一把密钥，对同一个位置，签了两个不同的消息。",
   "spoken": "同一把密钥，对同一个位置，签了两个不同的消息。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep17/audio/lines/seg4-03.mp3",
   "start": 15.172,
   "dur": 4.344,
   "speechStart": 15.27,
   "speechEnd": 18.662
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-04",
   "text": "凌晨，运维看到主机 A 失去响应，就在备用机 B 上启动同一把密钥。",
   "spoken": "凌晨，运维看到主机 A 失去响应，就在备用机 B 上启动同一把密钥。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep17/audio/lines/seg4-04.mp3",
   "start": 19.736,
   "dur": 6.24,
   "speechStart": 19.834,
   "speechEnd": 25.131
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-05",
   "text": "其实 A 没有停，两台机器对同一个 slot 各签一票。",
   "spoken": "其实 A 没有停，两台机器对同一个 slot 各签一票。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep17/audio/lines/seg4-05.mp3",
   "start": 26.196,
   "dur": 5.304,
   "speechStart": 26.294,
   "speechEnd": 30.663
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-06",
   "text": "网络检测到双签，验证者被罚没。",
   "spoken": "网络检测到双签，验证者被罚莫。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep17/audio/lines/seg4-06.mp3",
   "start": 31.72,
   "dur": 3.672,
   "speechStart": 31.818,
   "speechEnd": 34.556
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-07",
   "text": "公开的罚没事件，几乎都发生在故障切换或迁移时。",
   "spoken": "公开的罚莫事件，几乎都发生在故障切换或迁移时。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep17/audio/lines/seg4-07.mp3",
   "start": 35.612,
   "dur": 4.776,
   "speechStart": 35.71,
   "speechEnd": 39.567
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-08",
   "text": "2021 年 2 月，一家质押服务商重启出错，75 个验证者被罚没，约 18 ETH。",
   "spoken": "2021 年 2 月，一家质押服务商虫启出错，75 个验证者被罚莫，约 18 ETH。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep17/audio/lines/seg4-08.mp3",
   "start": 40.608,
   "dur": 7.032,
   "speechStart": 40.706,
   "speechEnd": 46.801
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-09",
   "text": "2023 年 10 月和 2025 年 9 月，Lido 和 SSV 网络上，也各有一批验证者被罚没。",
   "spoken": "2023 年 10 月和 2025 年 9 月，Lido 和 SSV 网络上，也各有一批验证者被罚莫。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep17/audio/lines/seg4-09.mp3",
   "start": 47.86,
   "dur": 7.608,
   "speechStart": 47.958,
   "speechEnd": 54.66
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-10",
   "text": "防线在流程，迁移前导出防罚没数据，确认旧实例已经停止。",
   "spoken": "防线在流程，迁移前导出防罚莫数据，确认旧实例已经停止。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep17/audio/lines/seg4-10.mp3",
   "start": 55.688,
   "dur": 6.072,
   "speechStart": 55.786,
   "speechEnd": 60.928
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-11",
   "text": "再等待至少 2 个 epoch，并开启分身检测，作为最后一道防线。",
   "spoken": "再等待至少 2 个 epoch，并开启分身检测，作为最后一道防线。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep17/audio/lines/seg4-11.mp3",
   "start": 61.98,
   "dur": 5.16,
   "speechStart": 62.078,
   "speechEnd": 66.304
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-12",
   "text": "签名的另一个风险，是看不见就签。",
   "spoken": "签名的另一个风险，是看不见就签。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep17/audio/lines/seg4-12.mp3",
   "start": 67.36,
   "dur": 3.648,
   "speechStart": 67.458,
   "speechEnd": 70.196
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-13",
   "text": "在 MEV-Boost 里，relay 托管构建者组装的完整区块，只给提议者区块头。",
   "spoken": "在 MEV-Boost 里，relay 托管构建者组装的完整区块，只给提议者区块头。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep17/audio/lines/seg4-13.mp3",
   "start": 71.228,
   "dur": 6.72,
   "speechStart": 71.326,
   "speechEnd": 77.099
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-14",
   "text": "提议者签名区块头，相信 relay 会发布完整区块并付款。",
   "spoken": "提议者签名区块头，相信 relay 会发布完整区块并付款。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep17/audio/lines/seg4-14.mp3",
   "start": 78.168,
   "dur": 5.304,
   "speechStart": 78.266,
   "speechEnd": 82.647
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-15",
   "text": "2023 年 4 月，一个恶意提议者，签了一个无效的区块头。",
   "spoken": "2023 年 4 月，一个恶意提议者，签了一个无效的区块头。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep17/audio/lines/seg4-15.mp3",
   "start": 83.692,
   "dur": 5.112,
   "speechStart": 83.79,
   "speechEnd": 87.98
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-16",
   "text": "旧代码照样返回区块体，他拆开三明治机器人的交易包，获利约 2000 万美元。",
   "spoken": "旧代码照样返回区块体，他拆开三明治机器人的交易包，获利约 2000 万美元。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep17/audio/lines/seg4-16.mp3",
   "start": 89.024,
   "dur": 6.744,
   "speechStart": 89.122,
   "speechEnd": 94.919
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-17",
   "text": "修复后，relay 先广播区块，再把区块交给提议者。",
   "spoken": "修复后，relay 先广播区块，再把区块交给提议者。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep17/audio/lines/seg4-17.mp3",
   "start": 95.988,
   "dur": 4.824,
   "speechStart": 96.086,
   "speechEnd": 99.967
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-18",
   "text": "relay 是可信中间人，验证者要评估自己用的 relay 和它的运营方。",
   "spoken": "relay 是可信中间人，验证者要评估自己用的 relay 和它的运营方。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep17/audio/lines/seg4-18.mp3",
   "start": 101.032,
   "dur": 5.976,
   "speechStart": 101.13,
   "speechEnd": 106.177
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-19",
   "text": "这个市场也很集中，2026 年 11 月的一个单日快照里，前两大构建者约占 74% 的区块。",
